provider, and it's like, oh,

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.800
I know what that is now.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.570
I'm going to send
that in for you.

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:02.320
Rather than me having
to do all that work.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.424
So that's pretty cool.

00:14:03.424 --> 00:14:04.340
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah.

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:05.620
That'd be really awesome.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:06.120
Yeah.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:11.060
So we're talking about these
