00:17:08.028 --> 00:17:10.569
RAM RAMANATHAN: Yeah, I think
that's really one of the things

00:17:10.569 --> 00:17:15.470
that we're enabling through
the TensorFlow framework

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:20.440
enables its ability to support
of a wide variety of devices.

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.910
So basically, you
can imagine people

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:26.579
are using really sophisticated
hardware to train

00:17:26.579 --> 00:17:28.830
these large speech
models, and then you

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.730
can imagine the
power of TensorFlow

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:33.210
is we can take that model
and actually just enable it

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:37.360
to run on your mobile device.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:41.900
Over time, this
allows users to think

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.540
about more intelligent
scenarios where

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.160
they can drive faster
response, in more real time,

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:49.740
integrate machine learning
real time into user workforce.

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:51.570
And that's really
where we can start

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:55.650
